Place the files of the IEEE Access LaTeX template here (ACCESS_latex_template_20240429:
ieeeaccess.cls, IEEEtran.cls, IEEEtran.bst, spotcolor.sty, bullet.png, logo.png, notaglinelogo.png and the
t1-formata-* font files). The official download is linked from
https://ieeeaccess.ieee.org/authors/submission-guidelines/ ; build_manuscript_ieeeaccess.py copies them next to
the .tex before compiling.
